Tests practical PCA deployment on edge hardware with streaming data, missing values, and latency constraints.

## Key Concepts

- Incremental PCA for streaming data
- Per-feature imputation and robust scaling
- Explained variance for component selection
- Drift monitoring and on-device alert translation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudocode: incremental fit on batches
const batch = getNextBatch();
const cleaned = batch.map((v, i) => isFinite(v) ? v : featureMeans[i]);
const scaled = scaler.transform(cleaned);
pca.partialFit(scaled);
const scores = pca.transform(scaled);
```

